{"timestamp":"2026-09-07T15:04:01.042Z","ordinal":30423,"type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","id":"ctc_02be90ffdd5dff4a016a9ed25345a087d0a1197bdec1b1480d","status":"completed","call_id":"call_p2lRiT2vlyuEYvKJtlCuHRak","name":"exec","input":"const replies = [\n[3949298250,\"The preview and real setup now both use --only repos,dotfiles and the same local seeded Git repository. The test asserts the preview clone command, then verifies the real checkout and README contents. The expanded test exposed ignored project declarations incorrectly blocking global sync; that implementation bug is fixed in the base. The complete remote setup test passes on restacked 1e8472eaf.\"],\n[3949421230,\"The empty-enrollment watcher remains a valid running service: it watches configuration for later enrollment. Added an empty-directory startup/shutdown test that asserts zero history commits, and fixed automatic capture so it does not create an unrelated empty root before fresh setup. The full watcher test passes on the revised base; included in 1e8472eaf.\"],\n[3950633508,\"Fixed in 1e8472eaf. The test waits for B to start, then for its edited file to have a clean history diff, records the completed-sync count after capture, and requires a later completed sync before checking origin. The full sync-auto test passes.\"],\n[3950635243,\"Fixed the fixture in 1e8472eaf: tracked files now live below MISE_CONFIG_DIR, independent of Pester temp-drive placement. Local lint passes; native Windows execution will be verified on this updated CI head.\"],\n[3950635248,\"Added explicit anchored rollback_review and sync_permissions cases to the macOS job in 1e8472eaf. Both tests pass locally on macOS, including their permission assertions; the combined sync-auto/rollback-review/sync-permissions run passed in 180 seconds.\"]\n];\nfor (const [id, body] of replies) text(await tools.exec_command({cmd:`env -u GH_TOKEN -u GITHUB_TOKEN gh api repos/jdx/mise/pulls/12919/comments/${id}/replies -f body='${body}\\n\\n*AI-assisted — Tool: Codex; model: unavailable; version: unavailable.*' --jq .html_url`,workdir:\"/Users/jdx/.codex/worktrees/dotfiles-git-acceptance/mise\",max_output_tokens:300}));\n","internal_chat_message_metadata_passthrough":{"turn_id":"01a07bd0-dc6b-77a2-a416-b785ee17b797","create_time":1788793421.876526}}}
